Ports the April 'codex via app-server JSON-RPC' payload — the last version
compatible with trunk's provider-container-registry. The newer payload-v2 on
origin/providers depends on registry fields (providesAgentSurfaces, groupDir)
that don't exist on trunk yet, and is WIP/broken at branch HEAD.

Dockerfile also re-applies local uncommitted mods (claude-code 2.1.197,
gmail-mcp block) that predate this change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
